  "articleBody": "Getting ready for AI search content strategy might seem daunting, but it’s really about getting back to basics and understanding how AI 'thinks.' Instead of guessing what keywords people are searching for, you need to think about the actual questions they're asking. AI systems are designed to answer these conversational queries, so your content needs to be structured to provide direct, clear answers. This means moving beyond just listing services and really diving into the specific problems your customers are trying to solve. \n\nWhat to Prepare Before You Start:\n\n- [ ] **Identify common customer questions** — Spend time understanding the exact questions your audience is asking about your services on various platforms like Quora, Reddit, or even your Google Business Profile Q&A. This helps ensure your content directly addresses their needs.\n- [ ] **Map topics to useful pages** — Don't just create content; ensure each piece provides a meaningful answer or solution. Think about the intent behind the question and how your business can uniquely address it.\n- [ ] **Gather evidence of expertise** — AI systems, much like human users, value trustworthiness. Make sure your content clearly demonstrates your business's expertise and provides transparent sourcing where applicable. This builds confidence in your answers.\n- [ ] **Review internal linking structure** — Good internal linking helps AI crawlers understand the relationships between your content pieces and improves discoverability. Think about how one answer can naturally lead to another relevant piece of information.\n- [ ] **Check your website's crawlability** — Ensure your site isn't inadvertently blocking AI crawlers. Basic checks on your robots.txt file and site structure are crucial for making sure your valuable content can actually be found.\n- [ ] **Keep business profiles updated** — For local businesses, ensuring your Google Business Profile and any Merchant Center information is accurate and current provides consistent, verifiable data for AI systems.\n\nHow to use this checklist:\nGo through each item on this list before embarking on a new AI search content strategy. This preparation helps ensure your efforts are focused on creating high-value, AI-citable content that genuinely serves your audience and improves your visibility in answer engines.",
  "datePublished": "2026-09-23"
